"Oost": "Oost",
"El Oosterpark, el Wereldmuseum, el mercado Dappermarkt y la cervecería del molino De Gooyer.": "The Oosterpark, the Wereldmuseum, the Dappermarkt and the brewery at the De Gooyer windmill.",
